        text ]
      text is a  language of the  branch, closely related to , , and . It was written in the  until the twentieth century.  was introduced and adopted in 1928, and was subsequently replaced on Stalin's orders by  in 1941. As a result of the pending language reform in neighboring , Kyrgyzstan will be the only independent  in a few years that exclusively uses the Cyrillic script.
